# cloudlabs — imperative SDK for Cloud Labs

Install from the monorepo (editable)::

    pip install -e ./packages/cloudlabs

Optional extras::

    pip install -e "./packages/cloudlabs[kernels,images]"

Usage (server must be running)::

    from cloudlabs import connect, resolve_backend_id

    with connect(resolve_backend_id(), base_url="http://127.0.0.1:8000") as lab:
        lab.prepare(catalog_pin="laser-cavity-main", reconcile=False)
        lab.components.tag_20.move(x=10.0).wait_until_idle()

Fluent + builtins example::

    python scripts/example_fluent_components.py

Author-defined TorchScript kernels + feature objectives::

    python scripts/example_session_kernel_author.py

See ``docs/SESSION_KERNELS.md`` and ``docs/Run_CloudLab_Scripts.md``.
